# Build: bounded YOLO

Offer only after showing eligible ready item set. Obtain one-time Epic-scoped consent naming set and limits. Repeatedly choose only ready bounded local slices from that set; run local tests and checkpoint each slice.

Stop at blocker, scope change, verification boundary, user stop, ambiguity, failed required check, or exhausted work. YOLO never authorizes remote/destructive actions, closure, merge, deploy, safety removal, work outside Epic, or set expansion.
